I used to be
mashed potatoes

174
00:06:46,929 --> 00:06:48,209
now I'm the gravy

175
00:06:48,249 --> 00:06:50,649
Nobody else is
quite this fine

176
00:06:50,689 --> 00:06:52,008
I'm the face

177
00:06:52,048 --> 00:06:53,288
I'm a real ace

178
00:06:53,328 --> 00:06:56,088
Nobody's visual
appeal is stronger

179
00:06:56,128 --> 00:06:58,768
I'm the very
definition of masculine grace

180
00:06:58,808 --> 00:06:59,528
Take a picture

181
00:06:59,568 --> 00:07:01,248
it'll last
you longer

182
00:07:01,288 --> 00:07:02,727
Cause I'm handsome

183
00:07:02,767 --> 00:07:04,287
I'm so
good looking

184
00:07:04,327 --> 00:07:05,487
I'm easy

185
00:07:23,942 --> 00:07:26,664
我哋公司想要提供你終身免費嘅高級鏡子

186
00:07:26,704 --> 00:07:27,585
送過來吧

187
00:07:27,625 --> 00:07:29,427
知唔知我係好handsome？

188
00:07:29,467 --> 00:07:30,509
即使都上大學喇

189
00:07:30,549 --> 00:07:32,150
我嘅孩子也要改成你的名字

190
00:07:32,190 --> 00:07:33,752
知唔知我係好handsome？

191
00:07:33,792 --> 00:07:37,316
Can't you see
that I'm handsome？

192
00:07:37,356 --> 00:07:38,037
Get in line，ladies

193
00:07:38,077 --> 00:07:40,239
Cause I'm handsome

194
00:07:40,279 --> 00:07:42,602
I'm a total catch
really

195
00:07:42,642 --> 00:07:45,364
I'm quite fetching

196
00:07:46,165 --> 00:07:47,446
It's a word

197
00:07:47,527 --> 00:07:48,487
it is

198
00:07:52,930 --> 00:07:54,490
恭喜你，漢斯

199
00:07:54,890 --> 00:07:56,571
在你47歲的時候

200
00:07:56,611 --> 00:07:58,971
你的魅力終於達到巔峰了

201
00:07:59,011 --> 00:08:00,732
